<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n72692" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἰσύπ-η</span></b> , ἡ, also
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἴσῠπος</span></b> , ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>the
				grease extracted from sheep's wool</i> (
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἴσυπος: τὸ ἐκ τῶν οἰσυπηρῶν ἐρίων
					λίπος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dsc.
					2.74
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plin.
				<u>HN</u>
				29.10
			</span></i>), <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἰσύπῃ</span> (
				v.l.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἴσπῃ</span>
			, q. v.) 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προβάτων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					4.187
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἰσύπη αἰγός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Mul.</u>
					2.195
				</span></i>
			 ; used for medicinal purposes, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
			</span></i> and <i><span class="en">
				Plin.
			</span></i> ll.cc.: —freq. confused with <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἰσπώτη</span> (q. v.).</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
